  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile and avgpool aggregation improve performance (config_018: 0.6186 accuracy). The RNA encoder (pca_n2000 in config_018) has shown lower performance in RNA-only settings compared to scvi_n200 (config_002: 0.5907 vs 0.4849). This experiment tests scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a multimodal multiprofile setup with avgpool and concat fusion, isolating the impact of RNA encoder choice. It directly addresses uncertainty about whether RNA encoder improvements from single-modality settings translate to multimodal performance, while keeping other factors constant."
